  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TCPF: Remote Sensing for Spatio-Temporal Mapping of Smog in Punjab and identification of the underlying causes using GIS Techniques (R-SMOG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to undertake a Geospatial research to detect/identify the causes of Smog in Punjab and to identify the relationship of Smog to Crop Residue burning.</narrative>
  </description>
